{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"valid\": true,\n  \"entry\": \"左上角紫色大字“不再需要他陪”首先吸引视线，随后落到同样醒目的灰色大字“一下安静了”。正文、右上角目录和下方音符动画处于次级视觉层。\",\n  \"grasp_who\": \"似乎已经不再需要他陪伴，整个人突然安静下来。\",\n  \"grasp_feel\": \"安静、收住、平静；是否真正释然不确定。\",\n  \"missed\": \"仍然有想靠近对方的冲动，而且并没有真正放松下来。声音逐渐下沉变暗、颤音和和弦悬停的氛围细节也不容易第一眼获得。\",\n  \"burden\": [\n    \"正文后两行较长，包含多层声音和氛围描写，需要进一步阅读才能理解细腻的情绪变化。\"\n  ],\n  \"score\": 3\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "21620850-62e0-4be6-9763-0af6a7b7b2f3", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261110T020640673201Z", "elapsed_seconds": 43.375, "completed_utc": "2026-11-10T02:07:24.049037+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "98a1ada929b50fb510764e7d7f12269ee6424f57cb17fa41413b4f6af4499b61", "attachment_count": 1}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 1, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be